// Lantern Bridge Events Reference

## 1. Ethereum (EVM) Contracts
**Source:** `packages/contracts/evm/src/Bridge.sol`

| Event Name | Arguments (Type & Name) | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Locked** | `bytes32 indexed depositId`<br>`address indexed user`<br>`address token`<br>`uint256 amount`<br>`string dstChain`<br>`string dstAccount`<br>`uint8 strategy` | User locks asset (ETH/ERC20) on Ethereum to bridge to destination. |
| **Released** | `bytes32 indexed depositId`<br>`address indexed user`<br>`uint256 amount` | Asset unlocked/released to user on Ethereum (inbound completion). |
| **MintedwCSPR** | `bytes32 indexed reqId`<br>`address indexed to`<br>`uint256 amount` | wCSPR minted on Ethereum (bridged from Casper). |
| **BurnedwCSPR** | `bytes32 indexed reqId`<br>`address indexed from`<br>`uint256 amount`<br>`string dstAccount` | User burns wCSPR to bridge back to Casper. |
| **StrategyUpdated** | `Strategy indexed strategy`<br>`address adapter` | Admin updates DeFi strategy adapter address. |

---

## 2. Casper (Rust) Contracts
**Source:** `packages/contracts/bridge_core/src/events.rs`
*Note: All Casper events include `event_type: u8` as the last field.*

| Event Name | Arguments (Rust Type) | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **UnlockRequested** | `request_id: String`<br>`recipient: Key`<br>`amount: U256`<br>`src_chain: String`<br>`dst_chain: String` | Relayer requests unlock on Casper (after observing lock on ETH/BurnedwCSPR). | 
| **UnlockFinalized** | `request_id: String`<br>`recipient: Key`<br>`amount: U256` | Multi-sig threshold reached, funds released to user. |
| **CeETHMintRequested** | `request_id: String`<br>`recipient: Key`<br>`amount: U256`<br>`src_chain: String`<br>`dst_chain: String` | Relayer requests mint ceETH on Casper (after observing ETH Locked). |
| **CeETHMinted** | `recipient: Key`<br>`amount: U256`<br>`tx_id: String` | ceETH minted on Casper (bridged from ETH). |
| **CsprLockedForTarget** | `sender: Key`<br>`amount: U256`<br>`dst_chain: String`<br>`tx_id: String`<br>`recipient: String` | User locks CSPR to bridge to target (ETH). |
| **CeETHBurned** | `eth_owner: String`<br>`amount: U256`<br>`tx_id: String` | User burns ceETH on Casper to bridge back to ETH. |
| **HotSwapProposed** | `patch_hash: String`<br>`proposer: Key` | Admin proposes contract upgrade. |
| **HotSwapActivated** | `patch_hash: String` | Upgrade approved and activated. |
| **PauseChanged** | `paused: bool` | Contract paused/unpaused. |
| **YieldAccrued** | `account: Key`<br>`principal_after: U256` | Yield/Interest accrued for user position. |

